;; SCOPE GUARD (constitutional, G1 — read first):
;;   - torifune is CIVILIAN LAUNCH ONLY, NEVER a weapon-delivery / ballistic-strike vehicle.
;;     :traj/class here is ONLY :orbit-insertion; :payload/class is ONLY a civilian class. No
;;     :depressed-strike / :suborbital-strike / :fobs / :munition / :kinetic appears, by design.
;;   - G2 zero-net-carbon: propellants are :hydrolox-green-h2 / :methalox-synthetic-net0 (net≤0);
;;     a :disfavored-fossil node is included ONLY to show the analyzer flags it (not used by Ama).
;;   - G5 debris-responsibility: the mission carries TWO disposal plans (stage recovery + upper-
;;     stage controlled re-entry); a mission with no disposal plan is refused by disposal_plan.py.
;;
;; SOURCING: all engineering numbers are :representative estimates (G8), NOT measured flight data
;; (no Ama flight campaign exists — that is Council-gated). Standards/agency rules would be
;; :authoritative once cited.

